          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Buy the Gravely Pro-Turn 260 if you want the most commercial mower for the money: ZT-5400 transaxles, a 7-gauge fabricated deck and five years of coverage. Step up to the Scag Turf Tiger II or Hustler Super Z if the mower will run all day, every day, and choose the Ferris ISX 2200 if ride comfort over rough ground matters most.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
